### FEATURE FLAG: same image, different behavior via FEATURE_BETA env var
$ docker run -d --name lab3-flag -p 5004:5000 -e FEATURE_BETA=false devops-lab3-app:3.0.0

flag OFF: curl http://localhost:5004/beta
HTTP 404
{"enabled":false,"feature":"beta"}


$ docker rm -f lab3-flag && docker run -d -e FEATURE_BETA=true ...   (flag toggled)

flag ON: curl http://localhost:5004/beta
HTTP 200
{"enabled":true,"feature":"beta","message":"Welcome to the beta feature"}

